{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S05把不安具体化为怕自己太黏、怕对方觉得负担，注意力从亲密本身及其可能消失，偏向了如何表达喜欢才不会造成压力。\",\n    \"S07明确加入对方是否需要他的陪伴、是否能从他身上获得安心，使幸福感部分转向确认自己对对方是否有用、是否被需要。\",\n    \"S08—S09、S11、S13反复沿着对方以后还需不需要自己、还会不会想到自己陪伴的方向发展，让主线有些偏向对自身陪伴角色能否维持的担忧，而不是亲密本身难以留住的痛楚。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S07、S11仍有一条对方是否需要自己陪伴、以后是否会想到自己的支线，略微把亲密具体化为被需要和被选择；但它没有像X那样扩展成主要关注点。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y更直接地围绕同一件事展开：亲近带来的幸福，以及意识到这份亲近未必能一直留住时产生的痛楚，两者不断相互牵动。X也包含这两面，但更明显地把部分重心转向了自己是否被需要、是否会成为对方的负担这一相邻但更具体的问题。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dbf7c46d-c2be-47be-b1b8-5f20fc05848a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T085521258007Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:55:55.562690+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fa0001e3206af954237924b63d4be33b851d4a11526c3e86c396913464b772dc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8e